<title>RUSSIA: RUSSIA SHARE INDEX UP 1.67 PCT TO RECORD 569.23.</title>
<headline>RUSSIA SHARE INDEX UP 1.67 PCT TO RECORD 569.23.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System 22-share index rose 1.67 percent on Friday to a record 569.23 closing on a strong $98.3 million total market turnover.</p>
<p>The previous record was set on Thursday, when the index closed at 559.86 on a record $120.7 million turnover.</p>
</text>
